      "node_id": "kg_doc_7",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "For Against is a United States post-punk/dream pop band from Lincoln, Nebraska. Despite numerous lineup shuffles and some periods of dormancy, the band has produced material steadily from its 1984 inception to the present.",
